In no event shall the author be liable for any claim, damages, or other
liability arising from the use of this software.

4. Third-party components
--------------------------
This source code depends on third-party R packages (caret, devtools,
FNN, ggplot2, ggpubr, glmnet, gplots, mixtools, RColorBrewer, readxl,
ROCR, Rsamtools, seewave, spatstat, stringr, transport) and Python
packages (numpy, pandas), none of which are bundled in this repository
-- see DEPENDENCIES.md. `est_rel_entro_HJW.py` is a Python port of the
HJW KL-divergence estimator, from Stanford University:
https://github.com/Mathegineer/HJW_KL_divergence_estimator
